---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`Work With Me — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="How Jay McDaniel serves as special valuation counsel to owners of closely held businesses and the attorneys who represent them."
>
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <h1>Work with me</h1>
    <p class="sub">Special valuation counsel</p>

    <p>I serve as special valuation counsel to owners of closely held businesses and to the attorneys who represent them. The engagement is usually narrow and high-stakes: the worth of a business, or of one owner's share of it, is at the center of a dispute or a transaction, and the number has to hold up.</p>

    <p>That work takes a few recurring shapes. In a business divorce or oppression case, I build or attack the valuation that decides the buyout. In a matrimonial matter, I value the business under the standard that governs and explain why it differs from what a sale would bring. In a tax controversy, I help construct the appraisal record before the gift, not after the notice. And when a valuation report needs to be dismantled, I know where adversarial reports break &mdash; and how to make that visible to a court.</p>

    <p>I also work with owners well before any dispute: on the operating-agreement and buy-sell terms that decide who controls the exit and at what price, and on the exit and succession planning that closes the value gaps &mdash; owner dependence, customer concentration, undocumented process &mdash; that otherwise cap the multiple years later.</p>

    <p>If you are a lawyer with a valuation problem you would rather not hand to just anyone, or an owner facing a dispute, a buyout, or a sale, one conversation tells us both whether it is a fit.</p>

    <div class="engage" style="border-radius:8px;margin-top:30px">
      <div class="inner">
        <div>
          <h4>Start with a strategy call.</h4>
          <p>Tell me what is in front of you. I will tell you plainly whether and how I can help.</p>
        </div>
        <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '')}`} class="cta">Schedule a strategy call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
